From: Harvi654 <202698022+Harvi654@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msi: Preserve post-cost Local feature requests for execution.

AI-assisted (Codex), original code; LGPL-2.1-or-later.

A successful immediate CA Local request after CostFinalize must update
Action as well as ActionRequest. In level mode propagate it through all
children (FP and non-FP), as measured in Windows v10, but do not implicitly
select descendants in ADDLOCAL mode.
Other states and pre-cost requests retain their previous behavior.

v2 (2026-11-05, Claude P2-1 review): restrict local_after_cost to
fresh installs (!Installed). Maintenance keeps vanilla Action, ancestor
and child propagation behavior. The maintenance test is MEASURE until
Windows x64/i686 values are supplied; no native states are guessed.

v3 (2026-11-05, native maintenance MEASURE from bundle b0ddb67):
Windows 10 x64/i686 reported Installed="00:00:00" and CostingComplete="0".
The CA now records property strings and return codes without requiring
literal "1" values or aborting the measurement. The sequence condition
Installed AND NOT REMOVE is unchanged. No production MSI logic or native
feature-state expectations change; v2 aborted before feature Set/Get.

The v7 and isolated v8 cases distinguish parent selection from CA updates
and verify final published states. Apply after the A and A2 patches.
Not in series pending full validation and clean-F L4.

V10 confirms immediate non-FP propagation in level mode and no propagation
in ADDLOCAL mode. All 60 additional final states are conformance assertions.
Post-cost Absent/Source requests are outside this fix.

diff --git a/dlls/msi/install.c b/dlls/msi/install.c
--- a/dlls/msi/install.c
+++ b/dlls/msi/install.c
@@ -914,6 +914,7 @@
 
 UINT MSI_SetFeatureStateW( MSIPACKAGE *package, LPCWSTR szFeature, INSTALLSTATE iState )
 {
+    BOOL local_after_cost;
     UINT rc = ERROR_SUCCESS;
     MSIFEATURE *feature, *child;
 
@@ -931,10 +932,25 @@
     }
 
     feature->ActionRequest = iState;
+    local_after_cost = iState == INSTALLSTATE_LOCAL && msi_get_property_int( package->db, L"CostingComplete", 0 ) && !msi_get_property_int( package->db, L"Installed", 0 );
+    if (local_after_cost) feature->Action = iState;
 
     ACTION_UpdateComponentStates( package, feature );
 
-    /* update all the features that are children of this feature */
+    /* Unlike the default-level guard in MSI_SetFeatureStates(), this is
+     * limited to measured ADDLOCAL behavior. Preselected includes other
+     * overrides whose post-cost propagation has not been measured. */
+    if (local_after_cost)
+    {
+        WCHAR *addlocal = msi_dup_property( package->db, L"ADDLOCAL" );
+        BOOL explicit_selection = addlocal && *addlocal;
+
+        free( addlocal );
+        /* An immediate CA does not implicitly extend an ADDLOCAL selection. */
+        if (explicit_selection) return rc;
+    }
+
+    /* In level mode a post-cost Local request propagates to all children (v10). */
     LIST_FOR_EACH_ENTRY( child, &package->features, MSIFEATURE, entry )
     {
         if (child->Feature_Parent && !wcscmp( szFeature, child->Feature_Parent ))
